wner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akinakamu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akinakamu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/engage-chat/mattermost/commits/1ff2c2daf84996f2bebaa9711c58a65a523da21e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T03:28:30Z","email":"235416384+akinakamu@users.noreply.github.com","name":"naka"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T07:09:03Z","email":"235416384+akinakamu@users.noreply.github.com","name":"naka"},"message":"Custom Build (#245)\n\n* Custom Build (#237)\n\n* 【Release 10.10】Custom Build (#118)\n\n* fix(ci): address classname mismatches\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: kondo <85671197+kondo97@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Disable login form (#157)\n\n* fix: Revert CSS replacements to JavaScript replacements in makefile customize (#243)\n\n* fix: Revert CSS replacements to JavaScript replacements\n\n* fix: loop all matched files and add post-replacement verification in custom-release.mk\n\n- Process all matched JS/CSS files in a loop instead of taking only the first match\n- Add post-replacement/post-append verification checks with exit 1 to prevent silent no-ops when upstream code changes\n\n* docs: add comment on caching constraints in custom-release.mk\n\n* fix: propagate exit code by replacing while-read pipe with for-loop\n\n- Replace while-read pipe with for-loop in GitLab icon and login form sections\n- Move 0-match check before the loop to ensure pattern missing errors and verification failures properly exit 1\n\n* fix: check generic_icons.login.gitlab absence in GitLab icon post-verification\n\n- Verify that generic_icons.login.gitlab no longer exists in the file rather than testing for strict icon_str regex\n\n- Ensures no-ops are detected if the sed pattern fails to match due to upstream changes\n\n* fix: include id in GitLab icon pattern to exclude i18n dictionary files\n\nSearching solely for ''generic_icons.login.gitlab'' matched both the UI component and the i18n language dictionary files. Because the dictionary file does not contain the SVG icon string, replacement was skipped and the post-verification check failed with an error.\n\nNarrowing the pattern to include ''id:'' ensures only the UI component file is targeted.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: kondo <85671197+kondo97@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"1ca128984a738b2feed3cc521d8bff0588df17bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/engage-chat/mattermost/git/trees/1ca128984a738b2feed3cc521d8bff0588df17bb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/engage-chat/mattermost/git/commits/1ff2c2daf84996f2bebaa9711c58a65a523da21e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/235416384?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akinakamu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akinakamu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akinakamu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akinakamu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/akinakamu","id":235416384,"login":"akinakamu","node_id":"U_kgDODggrQA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akinakamu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akinakamu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akinakamu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akinakamu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akinakamu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akinakamu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/engage-chat/mattermost/commit/1ff2c2daf84996f2bebaa9711c58a65a523da21e","node_id":"C_kwDOPKK3K9oAKDFmZjJjMmRhZjg0OTk2ZjJiZWJhYTk3MTFjNThhNjVhNTIzZGEyMWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/engage-chat/mattermost/co