st containers\n\n- Added details about user attribute refresh intervals in ABAC documentation.\n- Refactored environment resolution in Mattermost container to improve code clarity.\n- Enhanced logging to include server environment summary while starting test containers.\n- Implemented redaction for sensitive server environment variables in logs.\n\nCo-authored-by: saturnino <saturnino@mattermost.com>\n\n* Apply lint fixes\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n* ci(e2e): backport Cypress deps actions for release-11.7 E2E\n\nMaster E2E Tests (pull request) checkouts this SHA then probes\n./.github/actions/restore-cypress-deps. That composite action exists\non master but not on release-11.7, so Cypress prep-deps failed before\ninstall. Copy the restore/pack/unpack actions from master so the\ndispatched workflow can run against this cherry-pick.\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n* Align Playwright default config with 11.7 server\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: saturnino <saturnino@mattermost.com>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>","tree":{"sha":"c291966e5c3375ae8d10c0c8cd7f64bd6d6d963f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/engage-chat/mattermost/git/trees/c291966e5c3375ae8d10c0c8cd7f64bd6d6d963f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/engage-chat/mattermost/git/commits/9526fddcfb6c471c7ad7c7bb28ab08f4958a11a7","verification":{"payload":"tree c291966e5c3375ae8d10c0c8cd7f64bd6d6d963f\nparent 1b95c9e3a552b7e58fe8d938320ec84101cde387\nauthor sabril <5334504+saturninoabril@users.noreply.github.com> 1788762312 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788762312 +0800\n\nAutomated cherry pick of #38014 (#38359)\n\n* E2E/Playwright: Upgrade playwright@1.62 and its deps (#38014)\n\n* chore: upgrade playwright@1.62 and its deps\n\n* chore: add SyncJobIntervalSeconds and AttributeRefreshIntervalSeconds to policy details tests\n\n* fix: remove MM_FEATUREFLAGS_MOVETHREADSENABLED\n\n* remove MM_FEATUREFLAGS_ENABLEREMOTECLUSTERSERVICE\n\n* fix update login spec to enable, remove deprecated tests and update to postgres:15\n\n* Update documentation and enhance environment handling in test containers\n\n- Added details about user attribute refresh intervals in ABAC documentation.\n- Refactored environment resolution in Mattermost container to improve code clarity.\n- Enhanced logging to include server environment summary while starting test containers.\n- Implemented redaction for sensitive server environment variables in logs.\n\nCo-authored-by: saturnino <saturnino@mattermost.com>\n\n* Apply lint fixes\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n* ci(e2e): backport Cypress deps actions for release-11.7 E2E\n\nMaster E2E Tests (pull request) checkouts this SHA then probes\n./.github/actions/restore-cypress-deps. That composite action exists\non master but not on release-11.7, so Cypress prep-deps failed before\ninstall. Copy the restore/pack/unpack actions from master so the\ndispatched workflow can run against this cherry-pick.\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n* Align Playwright default config with 11.7 server\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: saturnino <saturnino@mattermost.com>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqnljICRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA0AcQAEnLVzB1u2lfsvURVRbbkVlN\n1nTSP5tGUTQdbugcpGfc6QNWMYWQCATCje9xs3A1YRSJTwEV4fyCCw7XWGJHSE3j\nTIirMpF6ibRdPghsSkGqZn/HtkSRDSE7t7dse+EX16ufRj/CRs6rUM3FrVC2LoxL\nIv74cG6QCZFdvwjtd5iS5YnX+H8rLgMmYuC7rGFv3VbqmWpazqep4psmfo8zb3zs\nvGc0ZpWDGoytORs7sA4nav5gnIZbS646GVPXB8orEGSrQnBO/Pa2ZIVHO6BoUa7e\nC+xV4waR9DVhbdBzHyDhyQnmRv1ZNFJkKaKTtwcN03r7Ln7OlDR