9e3a552b7e58fe8d938320ec84101cde387","node_id":"C_kwDOPKK3K9oAKDFiOTVjOWUzYTU1MmI3ZTU4ZmU4ZDkzODMyMGVjODQxMDFjZGUzODc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/engage-chat/mattermost/commit/3bfe9d1ba5317c59dda885821688950279459b81","sha":"3bfe9d1ba5317c59dda885821688950279459b81","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/engage-chat/mattermost/commits/3bfe9d1ba5317c59dda885821688950279459b81"}],"sha":"1b95c9e3a552b7e58fe8d938320ec84101cde387","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/engage-chat/mattermost/commits/1b95c9e3a552b7e58fe8d938320ec84101cde387"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1490756?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cpoile/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cpoile/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cpoile/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cpoile/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cpoile","id":1490756,"login":"cpoile","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0OTA3NTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cpoile/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cpoile/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cpoile/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cpoile/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cpoile/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cpoile","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/engage-chat/mattermost/commits/3bfe9d1ba5317c59dda885821688950279459b81/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T19:03:20Z","email":"cpoile@gmail.com","name":"Christopher Poile"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T19:03:20Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Cherry-pick #38330: fix dead Cypress image fixture on release-11.7 (#38341)\n\ndocs.mattermost.com migrated from Sphinx to Docusaurus, which removed the\n/_images/ static path. https://docs.mattermost.com/_images/icon-76x76.png now\nreturns 404, so the image proxy fails and the webapp renders the broken-image\nplaceholder instead. That breaks four specs on every run, independent of the\nchange under test:\n\n  - markdown/markdown_image_spec.js \"with in-line images 1\"\n  - messaging/inline_markdown_image_link_open_link_spec.js MM-T188\n  - files_and_attachments/image_link_preview_spec.js MM-T2389\n  - fixtures/markdown/markdown_inline_images_1.md\n\nThe icon is gone from the docs site entirely (no /img/, /static/img/,\n/img/brand/ or /assets/images/ equivalent), so point these at an image we\nactually own: the in-repo fixture mattermost-icon_128x128.png, served over\nraw.githubusercontent.com. That is the convention several sibling specs\nalready use, and it removes the dependency on the docs site''s asset layout.\n\nSize assertions move from 76px to 128px to match the new fixture. 128px stays\nunder the 350px max-height cap on .markdown-inline-img, so the image still\nrenders at its natural size. The height tolerance tightens from closeTo(76, 76)\n- which accepted anything from 0 to 152 and would have passed on a\nzero-height broken image - to closeTo(128, 2).\n\n(cherry picked from commit 75ab99a7dc7331c4f05dcee34997452ce3c4e4bd)\n\nCo-authored-by: Angelos Kyratzakos <angelos.kyratzakos@mattermost.com>","tree":{"sha":"a19f80ede12ec98697d6131cc99908bdd371a443","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/engage-chat/mattermost/git/trees/a19f80ede12ec98697d6131cc99908bdd371a443"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/engage-chat/mattermost/git/commits/3bfe9d1ba5317c59dda885821688950279459b81","verification":{"payload":"tree a19f80ede12ec98697d6131cc99908bdd371a443\nparent aeb5a2a6707cfa2841dceebc63dfd671c3537d0d\nauthor Christopher Poile <cpoile@gmail.com> 1788548600 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788548600 -0400\n\nCherry-pick #38330: fix dead Cypress image fixture on release-11.7 (#38341)\n\ndocs.mattermost.com migrated from Sphinx to Docusaurus, which removed the\n/_images/ static path. https://docs.mattermost.com/_images/icon-76x76.png now\nreturns 404, so the image proxy fails and the webapp renders the broken-image\nplaceholder instead. That breaks four specs on every run, independent of the\nchange under test:\n\n  - markdown/markdown_image_spec.js \"with in-line images 1\"\n  - messaging/inline_markdown_image_link_open_link_spec.js MM-T188\n  - files_and_attachments/image_link_preview_spec.js MM-T2389\n  - fixtures/markdown/markdown_inline_images_1.md\n\nThe icon is gone from the docs site entirely (no /img/, /static/img/,\n/img/brand/ or /assets/images/ equivalent), so point these at an image we\nactually own: the in-repo fixture mattermost-icon_128x128.png, served over\nraw.githubusercontent.com. That is the convention several sibling specs\nalready use, and it removes the dependency on the docs site''s asset layout.\n\nSize assertions move from 76px to 128px to match the new fixture. 128px stays\nunder the 350px max-height cap on .markdown-inline-img, so the image still\nrenders at its natural size. The height tolerance tightens from closeTo(76, 76)\n- which accepted anything from 0 to 152 and would have passed on a\nzero-height broken image - to closeTo(128, 2).\n\n(cherry picked from commit 75ab99a7dc7331c4f05dcee34997452ce3c4e4bd)\n\nCo-authored-by: Angelos Kyratzakos <angelos.kyratzakos@mattermost.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqmxX4CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAPbkQAI9f/sAp81yjV25ERlVBDSR+\nYfBskrPivbyxbFkYW3zdx5c+VgVfCNCByQ0LLIqIUbci1mfiLnB7NCzPsLt++AD9\nhu6OTiVcBFxw/pCZVGls4AEKqXPVQcL44LVd/Z/YRNZ8K5z5f7rokIEVt6RWdVxN\nM7XFJOguB2/fZ4hH2YQTxINM3sxHH9YtWOu/ttON1WMPMDnYt9um5iQz3fY7IvQq\no7jV408ZomCxifG0ikBeulj3S3we8d+DD5JI3WWLF373VAz2dYWtNe18Fqt7xkZu\n3eyZpWtEF7OR8CQnmKTSWsCCi5bomEcYE+/Kc1OPEDy/EDnKXdvB77odEXOo8SVq\nJAZdPKy2AtRE+2trCZsgyYVWrdoWmxTKH5tHospBSbx8py6gl7XvCem7LCCKs5WQ\nVEemRoCE5LggG4i+lt15UAKFA0jE58SQV2u8F1rufIQVptL/BdAgPeGuSzOw5+qN\