e32","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/engage-chat/mattermost/commits/a1ffc2f255caa90f88474dd32fae86337bbf9e32"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/282269886?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattermost-code/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattermost-code/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattermost-code/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattermost-code/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mattermost-code","id":282269886,"login":"mattermost-code","node_id":"U_kgDOENMYvg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattermost-code/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattermost-code/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattermost-code/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattermost-code/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattermost-code/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattermost-code","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/engage-chat/mattermost/commits/414e801e746e8f19a1917803b9849593321473a4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T13:38:35Z","email":"matty-code@mattermost.com","name":"mattermost-code"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T13:38:35Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"MM-69725: Propagate context through Extractor.Extract using new mattermost/pdf fork (#37579) (#38210)\n\n* Propagate context through Extractor.Extract\n\nAdds ctx context.Context to the Extractor interface and all\nimplementations so callers can cancel in-flight extractions.\n\npdfExtractor passes the context down to GetPlainText(ctx), which\nchecks ctx.Done() at each page boundary. When extractWithTimeout\nfires (deadline exceeded or parent cancel), it cancels the derived\ncontext via defer cancel(), and the PDF goroutine stops at the next\npage rather than running to completion, eliminating the heap\ngrowth that caused OOM on complex documents.\n\nFor non-context-aware extractors (docconv, plain, archive) the\ncontext is accepted but not yet acted on; they continue to run\nto completion on a detached goroutine after the timeout, as before.\n\nThe call site in channels/app/file.go passes rctx.Context() so\nrequest cancellation (e.g. HTTP disconnect) also propagates.\n\n* Use new mattermost/pdf fork\n\n* Update notice reflecting the new fork\n\n* Fail archiveExtractor.Extract early on ctx errors\n\n* Bump mattermost/pdf to cd8a834041c4\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Alejandro García Montoro <alejandro.garciamontoro@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Mattermost Build <build@mattermost.com>","tree":{"sha":"00fed13103ecbd6c7d18f0664f48b2e52fc80b30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/engage-chat/mattermost/git/trees/00fed13103ecbd6c7d18f0664f48b2e52fc80b30"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/engage-chat/mattermost/git/commits/414e801e746e8f19a1917803b9849593321473a4","verification":{"payload":"tree 00fed13103ecbd6c7d18f0664f48b2e52fc80b30\nparent 49281bd4fef0873e56990307db3d236b3b16c8fd\nauthor mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com> 1788183515 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788183515 +0000\n\nMM-69725: Propagate context through Extractor.Extract using new mattermost/pdf fork (#37579) (#38210)\n\n* Propagate context through Extractor.Extract\n\nAdds ctx context.Context to the Extractor interface and all\nimplementations so callers can cancel in-flight extractions.\n\npdfExtractor passes the context down to GetPlainText(ctx), which\nchecks ctx.Done() at each page boundary. When extractWithTimeout\nfires (deadline exceeded or parent cancel), it cancels the derived\ncontext via defer cancel(), and the PDF goroutine stops at the next\npage rather than running to completion, eliminating the heap\ngrowth that caused OOM on complex documents.\n\nFor non-context-aware extractors (docconv, plain, archive) the\ncontext is accepted but not yet acted on; they continue to run\nto completion on a detached goroutine after the timeout, as before.\n\nThe call site in channels/app/file.go passes rctx.Context() so\nrequest cancellation (e.g. HTTP disconnect) also propagates.\n\n* Use new mattermost/pdf fork\n\n* Update notice reflecting the new fork\n\n* Fail archiveExtractor.Extract early on ctx errors\n\n* Bump mattermost/pdf to cd8a834041c4\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Alejandro García Montoro <alejandro.garciamontoro@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Mattermost Build <build@mattermost.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqlYPbCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAo98QAClDDVsHsiVapk1akNqhqfk2\nzFkk5F5T2EidWGyIGGe4uIHxHeCj7xjAdE67OpIKEh7ssUDWR/cydO+XhcyC3hQI\nqNptxnQq0Ib7u36rKrMwveOeTFU7nia3hKDBD1nfzh5QAsa+9EufcYTOPtIhZTi2\ni41waK9RoDNb6meljJY11J16Sgc1Y+4n7TwJ9Pw8b9XcLZyajrO5cjzKv1LljxGG\n1ednLz6YfzxA4cv1EajytM8oKqQHAT3aPvoPIuiNuP4Josu8YQupOu5OuKYpSOds\nB4VQaKdtjangc8ZBVOysUGjcqharNyRqVjzd7Tu5qKXzXvmM1jtoZqAgUUhNFcMB\nM28+XyIKx1aVqubsAoTeTGSzebpQotYX/I5KDRtphlqPKqpEG5VvoCW7e1f8e9eQ\n6ZUipC7pOOD9NhVWiVWwzt+orbmYhYSEx/crZHH1C10y+x2t6Hc0vs9AQI9P7yum\n05K+3kx3pjrA2OTLApfxPFsfO1BwiFeLrud2AucH2lH2c/kdC4/V6FJfXjuMAzjJ\nYRzeDRa3qsSLOjc8pCr0QY8UfaJUQeHdaNTxQgDipuXDw7GPToozZZUG9gfwkzS4\nQHPtsVUKxo2S8rTU7aj+qu9Jnu+7lJPZ4L3XOYyIXavMA9ttHApwTYm7LDTvQI2Y\nglVtH/4hUd6TDHp5FbkS\n=UiMT\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-16T02:32:51Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node