":[{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/duclong565/timesheet-management-fe/commits/3f233b7cd1c4f3559f5dba30a118d64b03abe4c2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-02T15:20:56Z","email":"Dean.Nguyen@cebupacific.com","name":"Dean.Nguyen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-02T15:20:56Z","email":"Dean.Nguyen@cebupacific.com","name":"Dean.Nguyen"},"message":"Clean up lint violations and remove debug logging\n\n- Replace all remaining explicit `any` (202 -> 0) with domain types from\n  @/types, unknown, or precise inline types; no eslint-disable used.\n- Remove all unused imports and variables.\n- Strip 188 debug console.log/info/debug calls across the app; keep\n  console.error/console.warn for genuine error reporting.\n- Escape unescaped JSX entities; tidy a couple of safe hook deps.\n\nESLint: 0 errors (2 hook-dependency warnings intentionally left, as adding\nthe deps would risk re-render loops). `tsc --noEmit` passes and `next build`\ncompletes successfully.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0f21f958aa68b958a1e3d9295f3f207ee338ae76","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/duclong565/timesheet-management-fe/git/trees/0f21f958aa68b958a1e3d9295f3f207ee338ae76"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/duclong565/timesheet-management-fe/git/commits/3f233b7cd1c4f3559f5dba30a118d64b03abe4c2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/duclong565/timesheet-management-fe/commit/3f233b7cd1c4f3559f5dba30a118d64b03abe4c2","node_id":"C_kwDOPLc5vtoAKDNmMjMzYjdjZDFjNGYzNTU5ZjVkYmEzMGExMThkNjRiMDNhYmU0YzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/duclong565/timesheet-management-fe/commit/a9ca62f69c7270eb424bfdc1d5d499115a81ac1a","sha":"a9ca62f69c7270eb424bfdc1d5d499115a81ac1a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/duclong565/timesheet-management-fe/commits/a9ca62f69c7270eb424bfdc1d5d499115a81ac1a"}],"sha":"3f233b7cd1c4f3559f5dba30a118d64b03abe4c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/duclong565/timesheet-management-fe/commits/3f233b7cd1c4f3559f5dba30a118d64b03abe4c2"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/duclong565/timesheet-management-fe/commits/a9ca62f69c7270eb424bfdc1d5d499115a81ac1a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-02T15:02:41Z","email":"Dean.Nguyen@cebupacific.com","name":"Dean.Nguyen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-02T15:02:41Z","email":"Dean.Nguyen@cebupacific.com","name":"Dean.Nguyen"},"message":"Fix TypeScript build errors and tighten types\n\nThe project did not type-check (74 errors) and therefore could not run a\nproduction build. Resolve all of them without changing runtime behaviour:\n\n- api-client: replace `any` request/response types with domain types\n  (Permission, Role, User, RoleWithPermissions, ...) or `unknown`, and use\n  PaginatedResponse where callers read `.pagination`.\n- form-field: make FormField generic and infer the form type from\n  `register`, fixing UseFormRegister<FieldValues> mismatches across forms.\n- forms: let useForm infer input/output from the zod resolver instead of\n  forcing the output type, fixing resolver/Control/handleSubmit variance.\n- react-query v5: mutation `isLoading` -> `isPending`.\n- types: add missing optional fields to Request (reason, location,\n  time_type, start_time, end_time) and Project (description); type the four\n  `any` fields on Request.\n- hooks: use sonner toast in use-project-team-management; type query-cache\n  updaters; coerce string|number money; misc null/undefined guards.\n- theme-provider: import ThemeProviderProps from next-themes.\n\n`tsc --noEmit` now passes with 0 errors.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"564dc32f77f5d52a9eb723718399d7170c341b3d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/duclong565/timesheet-management-fe/git/trees/564dc32f77f5d52a9eb723718399d7170c341b3d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/duclong565/timesheet-management-fe/git/commits/a9ca62f69c7270eb424bfdc1d5d499115a81ac1a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/duclong565/timesheet-management-fe/commit/a9ca62f69c7270eb424bfdc1d5d499115a81ac1a","node_id":"C_kwDOPLc5vtoAKGE5Y2E2MmY2OWM3MjcwZWI0MjRiZmRjMWQ1ZDQ5OTExNWE4MWFjMWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/duclong565/timesheet-management-fe/commit/32c69d028e0a5f95bdc428977bab763098989451","sha":"32c69d028e0a5f95bdc428977bab763098989451","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/duclong565/timesheet-management-fe/commits/32c69d028e0a5f95bdc428977bab763098989451"}],"sha":"a9ca62f69c7270eb424bfdc1d5d499115a81ac1a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/duclong565/timesheet-management-fe/commits/a9ca62f69c7270eb424bfdc1d5d499115a81ac1a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/duclong565/timesheet-management-fe/commits/32c69d028e0a5f95bdc428977bab763098989451/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-02T15:02:41Z","email":"Dean.Nguyen@cebupacific.com","name":"Dean.Nguyen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-02T15:02:41Z","email":"Dean.Nguyen@cebupacific.com","name":"Dean.Nguyen"},"message":"Remove dead scratch code\n\nDelete the dev-only auth integration test page (/test), its component,\nand the loose test-api.js browser console script. None were referenced\nfrom application code.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cff49e424b5b74fb707479c1007ada3d9fc395e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/duclong565/timesheet-management-fe/git/trees/cff49e424b5b74fb707479c1007ada3d9fc395e3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/duclong565/timesheet-management-fe/git/commits/32c69d028e0a5f95bdc428977bab763098989451","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"c